language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ComputeArchive.
condition ComputeArchiveReady.
condition ComputeArchiveContinue.
condition ComputeArchiveReject.
outcome ComputeArchiveCompleted.
outcome ComputeArchiveRejected.
step ComputeArchiveSchedule.
step ComputeArchiveCompute.
step ComputeArchiveAccept.
step ComputeArchivePublish.
step ComputeArchiveFailure.
step ComputeArchiveSuccess.

ComputeArchive illustrates InspectBuckingAlternatives.
ComputeArchive exercises RankedLegalBucking.
ComputeArchive starts-when ComputeArchiveReady.
ComputeArchive starts-at ComputeArchiveSchedule.
ComputeArchiveReady describes "A frozen planning input exists and background policy permits archive work.".
ComputeArchiveContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ComputeArchiveReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
ComputeArchiveCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ComputeArchiveRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ComputeArchive preserves DomainTruthOwned.
ComputeArchiveSchedule calls ScheduleQuietArchive within BuckingService.
ComputeArchiveSchedule describes "Background/cancellable work must not block current K1.".
ComputeArchiveSchedule proceeds-to ComputeArchiveFailure when ComputeArchiveReject.
ComputeArchiveSchedule proceeds-to ComputeArchiveCompute when ComputeArchiveContinue.
ComputeArchiveCompute calls ComputeBestArchive within BuckingService.
ComputeArchiveCompute describes "Preserve deterministic ties and one-best parity.".
ComputeArchiveCompute proceeds-to ComputeArchiveFailure when ComputeArchiveReject.
ComputeArchiveCompute proceeds-to ComputeArchiveAccept when ComputeArchiveContinue.
ComputeArchiveAccept calls AcceptPlanningResult within BuckingService.
ComputeArchiveAccept describes "Reject stale results from older input/session.".
ComputeArchiveAccept proceeds-to ComputeArchiveFailure when ComputeArchiveReject.
ComputeArchiveAccept proceeds-to ComputeArchivePublish when ComputeArchiveContinue.
ComputeArchivePublish calls PublishBuckingState within BuckingService.
ComputeArchivePublish describes "Publish only accepted ranked alternatives.".
ComputeArchivePublish proceeds-to ComputeArchiveFailure when ComputeArchiveReject.
ComputeArchivePublish proceeds-to ComputeArchiveSuccess when ComputeArchiveContinue.
ComputeArchiveFailure finishes ComputeArchive with ComputeArchiveRejected.
ComputeArchiveSuccess finishes ComputeArchive with ComputeArchiveCompleted.
ComputeArchive runs-alongside PlanCurrentStem.
